msgid "Take it one step at a time"
msgstr ""

#: src/ubuntu_start.py:129
msgid "You can come back to any guide whenever you need it."
msgstr ""

#: src/ubuntu_start.py:133
msgid ""
"A few useful places to begin. Ubuntu may ask for your password when you "
"change system settings."
msgstr ""

#: src/ubuntu_start.py:135
msgid "Language and keyboard"
msgstr ""

#: src/ubuntu_start.py:135
msgid "Choose your display language, region and keyboard layout."
msgstr ""

#: src/ubuntu_start.py:136
msgid "Internet connection"
msgstr ""

#: src/ubuntu_start.py:136
msgid "Connect to Wi-Fi or a wired network."
msgstr ""

#: src/ubuntu_start.py:137
msgid "Updates"
msgstr ""

#: src/ubuntu_start.py:137
msgid "Check for system updates and restart if Ubuntu asks you to."
msgstr ""

#: src/ubuntu_start.py:138
msgid "Sound and display"
msgstr ""

#: src/ubuntu_start.py:138
msgid "Choose speakers, microphone and monitor settings."
msgstr ""

#: src/ubuntu_start.py:139
msgid "Privacy and screen lock"
msgstr ""

#: src/ubuntu_start.py:139
msgid "Review app permissions and automatic screen locking."
msgstr ""

#: src/ubuntu_start.py:152
msgid ""
"Choose a device and try these checks in order. They do not install software "
"or change system files."
msgstr ""

#: src/ubuntu_start.py:158
msgid "Suggested checks"
msgstr ""

#: src/ubuntu_start.py:165
msgid "Open related Settings"
msgstr ""

#: src/ubuntu_start.py:177
msgid "Graphics drivers"
msgstr ""

#: src/ubuntu_start.py:177
msgid ""
"Ubuntu can offer compatible drivers for some graphics hardware. Review the "
"available choices in Ubuntu’s Additional Drivers tool before installing "
"anything."
msgstr ""

#: src/ubuntu_start.py:178
msgid "Review available drivers"
msgstr ""

#: src/ubuntu_start.py:178
msgid ""
"This opens Ubuntu’s driver tool. Read the recommendation and confirm any "
"changes there."
msgstr ""

#: src/ubuntu_start.py:178
msgid "Open Drivers"
msgstr ""

#: src/ubuntu_start.py:179
msgid "Secure Boot"
msgstr ""

#: src/ubuntu_start.py:179
msgid ""
"Some drivers need a one-time confirmation during restart when Secure Boot is "
"enabled. Follow Ubuntu’s on-screen instructions."
msgstr ""

#: src/ubuntu_start.py:180
msgid "Need more detail?"
msgstr ""

#: src/ubuntu_start.py:180
msgid "Ubuntu’s driver guidance explains the supported installation route."
msgstr ""

#: src/ubuntu_start.py:180
msgid "Open Ubuntu help"
msgstr ""

